{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10231210","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10231210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:5:1023121001:0":{"text":"로리엣! 더는 만나지 못하는 줄 알았어요... 여기서 쭉 당신을 기다리고 있었어요!","source_cn":"罗丽叶！我以为我再也见不到你了……我一直这里在等你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x511DBE1E369E1292","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1023121002:0":{"text":"줄리오, 저도 당신이 그리웠어요! 다쳤다고 들었는데, 괜찮나요? 어디 좀 봐요!","source_cn":"朱密欧，我也一直在思念你！听说你受伤了，伤的重吗？让我看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B6541376F568B17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1023121003:0":{"text":"당신을 만날 수 있다면 이 정도 상처쯤은 아무것도 아니에요.","source_cn":"能够见到你，再重的伤又算得上什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x352B335D10FD7275","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1023121004:0":{"text":"줄리오, 앞으로 그 무엇도 우리를 갈라놓을 수 없을 거예요.","source_cn":"朱密欧，从今往后，再也没有什么能把我们分开了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E9C7C1F7380C285","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1023121005:0":{"text":"네, 영원히.","source_cn":"是的，再也没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B3A921B345631A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":